Read AGENTS.md at the repo root first; it is the entry point for AI agents.
Detail lives in CLAUDE.md (architecture, commands) and TESTING.md (tests).

Key rules:
- Verify the environment before changing anything: bin/test.sh --verify
- PHPUnit testsuite names are CASE-SENSITIVE (Helper, model, External,
  Controllers, "SPIO Main"). An unknown name prints "No tests executed!" and
  exits 0 — always check the test count.
- --filter takes a CLASS name, not a file path.
- Never edit build/shortpixel/ (bundled/generated from ../modules/*).
- No bug numbers in code, tests or docs (bug tracking is internal): open
  defects are @todo notes; pinned tests end in _pinned_for_deferred_fix.
